{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>את אלה.</b> The things to come." "<b>יי אהבו.</b> A sign for Cyrus." "<b>יעשה חפצו.</b> The desire of HaShem concerning Babylon. <b>[וזרעו כשדים].</b> And He shall make His arm against the Chaldeans, and it is possible that the vav of חפצו refers back to Cyrus, and likewise the vav of וזרועו."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {2 "Ibn Ezra quotes a variant or emendation [וזרעו כשדים] apparently reflecting a different reading of the verse; translated as bracketed in the source."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:35.244199489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}